{"id":"s7g41ifll5iphqoejrm6vwj74","title":"某团队在 Nature 发表研究：早期四足动物颈部进化与运动能力的关系再审视","originalTitle":"Scientists discover that necks didn't evolve for the reason we thought","summary":"某团队在 Nature 发表研究：早期四足动物颈部进化与运动能力的关系再审视。该研究通过化石分析、现代鲟鱼生物力学实验及计算机模型，发现首具分界颅肩的鱼类颈部僵硬度极高，无法有效转动头部，支持颈部结构是适应四肢支撑运动的副产品这一新假说。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 综合"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261108233101.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T23:49:03.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T04:58:15.404Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T04:58:15.404Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":75,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"77540772-53d6-41a6-ad66-44521baa4b16","title":"早期四足动物颈部进化新假说：为四肢支撑的副产品"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"77540772-53d6-41a6-ad66-44521baa4b16","title":"早期四足动物颈部进化新假说：为四肢支撑的副产品"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f96UlgMUso_E","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}